       Note that all but wwiinnssddeellllnn may be macros.

       These  routines do not require a hardware line delete or insert feature
       in the terminal.  In fact, they will not use hardware  line  delete/in‐
       sert unless iiddllookk((......,, TTRRUUEE)) has been set on the current window.

